SUMMARY:Members-Only Fall Plant Sale
DESCRIPTION:Become a Duke Gardens member and join us for the Members-Only Fall Plant Sale on Friday\, September 25! You’ll find an array of plants ideal for this region\, including Duke Gardens plants\, trees\, shrubs\, vines and bulbs\, as well as expert gardening advice from Duke Gardens’ staff and volunteers. Attendees must become Duke Gardens members ahead of the sale. Spaces are limited\, and advance registration for the sale is required. \nBecome a Duke Gardens member.
